{'symbol': 'CNC', 'date': '2022-05-10 07:00:00', 'title': 'BEHAVIORAL HEALTH CENTER OF EXCELLENCE AND CENTENE ANNOUNCE PARTNERSHIP TO ADVANCE QUALITY IN AUTISM TREATMENT OUTCOMES', 'text': "LOS ANGELES & ST. LOUIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BEHAVIORAL HEALTH CENTER OF EXCELLENCE (BHCOE), A DATA-DRIVEN HEALTHCARE ACCREDITOR, TODAY ANNOUNCED A STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP WITH CENTENE CORPORATION (NYSE:CNC) THAT WILL RESEARCH AND ADVANCE CONTINUOUS IMPROVEMENT IN APPLIED BEHAVIORAL ANALYSIS (ABA) TREATMENT DELIVERY AND SUPPORT ACCESS TO QUALITY SERVICES FOR PEOPLE ON THE AUTISM SPECTRUM AND RELATED DEVELOPMENTAL DISABILITIES. THIS PARTNERSHIP BRINGS TOGETHER BHCOE'S QUALITY MEASUREMENT EXPERTISE AS"}